    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44779" root="&#xA;                        وهى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهَى</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, much slit,</i> or <i>rent.</i>
(Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, lax, flaccid,</i> or
<i>flabby:</i> (Msb:) or <i>weak;</i> said of a rope, (Mgh,)
or other thing: or <i>it fell.</i> (Msb.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَاهٍ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهَِىَ</span>
                        <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, uncompact, unsound,</i> or
<i>weak.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهَى أَمْرُهُ</span> [<i>His affair,</i> or <i>case, was,</i> or
<i>became, in a weak,</i> or <i>an unsound, state</i>]. (TA,
art.<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نغض</span>, &amp;c.)

